>> > According to the manuals/docs all that is needed is 1MBx36bit 72pin
>> > parity checked SIMMs 70 ns or better.  We have tried chips from multiple
>> > vendors and none have worked, the console test shows the whole bank
>> > (4095 pages) as bad.


>> > On Alpha systems you need to install a SIMM for Parity of equal size in a
