>only 4 SIMM's to fill a bank. The # of SIMM's you need to fill a bank,
>depends on the machine and CPU type.

>Gregor


Gregor,

  I have 2 alpha 1000 4/233's. Even though they are earlier models than your 
1000a 5/xxx, I have 4 controlling sim slots for each of my banks of 4 sim 
slots 
available. If I do not put a matching sim in a matching 'controller' slot then 
the pages all read as bad and the server does not boot properly. If your 
machine has 20 slots then you have 4 'controlling' slots and 4 banks of 4 for 
the memory the machine uses.

Mike Curran




