hello

has anybody had problems running the perl IPC server available in
Perl 5.002 man pages on OSF1 V4.0? i can't seem to get the server
to communicate with clients (especially talking back to the client).
any input would be appreciated.
i do not have a lot of experience with sockets.
the server in this message.

thanks.

