Hi Todd,

have a look at lmf(8).

You could just:

1. lmf issue file product [producer [authorization]]
where file is the name of the file to write the licence to, and producer
and authorization are needed in case of ambiguity;

2. upgrade your system;

3. lmf register - < file
to reload licences from each of the files created at step 1;

4. lmf reset
to reactivate your licences.

